# Mi Óptica — Componentes: Botones, Badges, Alertas

## 1. Botones — HTML canónico
```html
<button class="btn btn-primary"   type="submit">Guardar ficha</button>
<button class="btn btn-accent"    type="button">Entregar pedido</button>
<button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button">Cancelar</button>
<button class="btn btn-ghost"     type="button">Ver historial</button>
<button class="btn btn-danger"    type="button">Eliminar producto</button>

<!-- Solo icono: siempre con aria-label -->
<button class="btn btn-ghost" aria-label="Eliminar venta">
  <svg aria-hidden="true"><!-- icono --></svg>
</button>

<!-- Con loader HTMX -->
<button class="btn btn-primary btn-loading"
        hx-post="/ventas/guardar" hx-indicator="this">
  <span class="btn-text">Guardar venta</span>
</button>
```

## 2. Botones — CSS
```css
.btn {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--sp-1);
  padding: 9px var(--sp-3); border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--text-base);
  font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; border: none;
  transition: background var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std),
              transform  var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-std);
  white-space: nowrap; text-decoration: none;
}
.btn:focus-visible { outline: none; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #fff, 0 0 0 4px var(--cyan-400); }
.btn:active        { transform: scale(0.98); }
.btn:disabled      { opacity: .45; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none !important; }
.btn-sm { font-size: var(--text-sm); padding: 6px 14px; }
.btn-lg { font-size: var(--text-md); padding: 12px 28px; }

.btn-primary   { background: var(--navy-900); color: #fff; }
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--navy-700); transform: translateY(-1px); }

.btn-accent    { background: var(--cyan-400); color: var(--navy-900); font-weight: 600; }
.btn-accent:hover { background: var(--cyan-600); color: #fff; }

.btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: var(--navy-700); border: 1.5px solid var(--navy-300); }
.btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--navy-50); }

.btn-ghost     { background: transparent; color: var(--slate-500); border: 1px solid var(--slate-300); }
.btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--slate-100); color: var(--slate-700); }

.btn-danger    { background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger); border: 1px solid #FECACA; }
.btn-danger:hover { background: var(--danger); color: #fff; }

/* Estado de carga */
.btn-loading   { pointer-events: none; opacity: .75; position: relative; }
.btn-loading .btn-text { opacity: 0; }
.btn-loading::after {
  content: ''; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%;
  margin: -8px 0 0 -8px; width: 16px; height: 16px;
  border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); border-top-color: #fff;
  border-radius: 50%; animation: spin 650ms linear infinite;
}
@keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
```

## 3. Badges — HTML y CSS
```html
<span class="badge badge--navy">Administrador</span>
<span class="badge badge--cyan">Optometrista</span>
<span class="badge badge--success">Entregado</span>
<span class="badge badge--warning">En laboratorio</span>
<span class="badge badge--danger">Saldo pendiente</span>
<span class="badge badge--neutral">Sin stock</span>
```
```css
.badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 3px 10px;
         border-radius: var(--radius-full); font-size: var(--text-xs);
         font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; }
.badge--navy    { background: var(--navy-100);   color: var(--navy-700); }
.badge--cyan    { background: var(--cyan-50);    color: var(--cyan-600); }
.badge--success { background: var(--success-bg); color: var(--success); }
.badge--warning { background: var(--warning-bg); color: var(--warning); }
.badge--danger  { background: var(--danger-bg);  color: var(--danger);  }
.badge--neutral { background: var(--slate-100);  color: var(--slate-700);}
```

## 4. Alertas
```html
<!-- Siempre role="alert" para feedback dinámico -->
<div class="alert alert--success" role="alert">
  <strong>Venta registrada</strong> — La orden fue guardada y el inventario actualizado.
</div>
<div class="alert alert--warning" role="alert">
  <strong>Stock bajo:</strong> Ray-Ban RB3447 tiene solo 2 unidades.
</div>
<div class="alert alert--danger"  role="alert">
  <strong>Error:</strong> El NIT ingresado no tiene un formato válido.
</div>
<div class="alert alert--info"    role="alert">
  Orden en laboratorio. Listo en 3–5 días hábiles.
</div>
```
```css
.alert { display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-md);
         font-size: var(--text-base); align-items: flex-start; }
.alert--success { background: var(--success-bg); color: #166534; border: 1px solid #BBF7D0; }
.alert--warning { background: var(--warning-bg); color: #92400E; border: 1px solid #FDE68A; }
.alert--danger  { background: var(--danger-bg);  color: #9F1239; border: 1px solid #FECDD3; }
.alert--info    { background: var(--info-bg);    color: #1E40AF; border: 1px solid #BFDBFE; }
```

## 5. Toast Notifications (JS vanilla)
```javascript
const Toast = {
  _container: null,
  _getContainer() {
    if (!this._container) {
      this._container = Object.assign(document.createElement('div'), {
        className: 'toast-container'
      });
      document.body.appendChild(this._container);
    }
    return this._container;
  },
  show(msg, type = 'success', ms = 3500) {
    const t = Object.assign(document.createElement('div'), {
      className: `toast toast--${type}`, textContent: msg
    });
    this._getContainer().appendChild(t);
    setTimeout(() => {
      t.classList.add('toast--exit');
      t.addEventListener('animationend', () => t.remove(), { once: true });
    }, ms);
  },
  success: (m) => Toast.show(m, 'success'),
  error:   (m) => Toast.show(m, 'error',   5000),
  warning: (m) => Toast.show(m, 'warning'),
};
```
